# Clipper / ReplayForge — out of scope

Clip Studio and ReplayForge are **not** Streamclone product surfaces.

- Do **not** re-add `clipper/`, `ClipStudio*`, `/studio` routes, or `/v1/clipper` proxy work here.
- Active Clip Studio lives in sibling **replayforge**. Analytics/clip moments live in **streampulse-backend** / **streamclone-pulse**.
- See [`docs/streampulse-product-boundary.md`](../../docs/streampulse-product-boundary.md).
